A||||2||Cliff Pennock||An addition to the forum...
Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||05-18-99||04:45 PM||||Hi all, I've just made a small but very handy addition to the forum: as you may have noticed, everytime you enter the forum it will show all messages from the past 20 days. At the top of each topic listing you were able to choose which messages you wanted to see (from last day, last two days, last 5 days, etc). But the software never remembered that setting so the next time it was always back at 20 days. I've changed the code now so it will set a cookie on your machine as soon as you change this value. So the next time you enter the forum, it will still remember from how many days you want to view the messages. Cool huh? :)<p>I know, I know, the commercial version of this software has this build in, but like I said on another thread I'm still a bit hesitant buying the commercial version because it contains a few bugs that can hang the server...<p>Until they have resolved that bug, I will continue to add my own stuff to <b>this</b> version.
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||05-18-99||05:10 PM||||Oooops! I had accidently removed the <b>Submit Reply</b> and <b>Submit New Topic</b> buttons... But they're back now!
